1 NAME Catharina /Zaaijman/
2 GIVN Catharina
2 SURN Zaaijman
2 NICK Zaayman
2 NICK Catharina Zaaijman
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 SEP 1678
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Mauritius
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1714
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Batavia
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.zaaiman.nl/Stamboom/Zuid-Afrika/Zuid-Afrika.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Parenteel van Daniel Zaaiman
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Daniel Zaaiman is geboren in 1650 in Nederland. Daniel is overleden in 1714 in Stellenbosch (Z.A.), 63 of 64 jaar oud (oorzaak: Pokken). Daniel trouwde, 26 of 27 jaar oud, op 13-10-1677 in Mauritius met Petronella van Meerhof, 1
2 CONC 3 of 14 jaar oud. Petronella is geboren in 1663 in Kaap (Z.A.), dochter van Pieter van Meerhof en Eva Goringhaicona. Petronella is overleden in 1713 in Stellenbosch (Z.A.), 49 of 50 jaar oud.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kinderen van Daniel en Petronella:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Catharina Zaaiman, geboren op 27-09-1678 in Mauritius. Volgt 1.1.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1 Catharina Zaaiman is geboren op 27-09-1678 in Mauritius, dochter van Daniel Zaaiman (zie 1) en Petronella van Meerhof. Catharina is overleden vóór 1714 in Batavia (Indonesie), ten hoogste 36 jaar oud. Catharina trouwde, ongeve
2 CONC er 31 jaar oud, omstreeks 1709 met Roelof Diodati. Roelof is geboren in Dordrecht (NL). Roelof is overleden op 10-03-1723 in Batavia (Indonesie). Roelof trouwde later na 1714 in Batavia (Indonesie) met Maria de Blocq.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kinderen van Catharina en Roelof:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Elisabeth Diodati [1.1.1]. Elisabeth is overleden.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Agatha Diodati [1.1.2]. Agatha is overleden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bygevoeg deur Y. DROST, 17 JAN 2016
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ===b1 Page 17 “SA Genealogies” vol 17, Genealogical Institute of SA, Stellenbosch, 2008”
2 CONT
2 CONT This source gives date of marriage c. 1694
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband, Roelof Diodati, was the Commander of Mauritius between 13 august 1692 and 26 July 1703.
2 CONT She married Roelof at the age of 31 and died when she was 36. I have found two other children from a different source from their two sons so I am hoping more info can be found on them. One source names the two boys and the other t
2 CONC wo girls?
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT I don't think she had any daughters, or they died young, without leaving descendants. Cf Daniel Zaaijman's inventory dated 1 Dec 1713:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Staet en inventaris van alle de goederen naergelaten en met er doot ontruijmt bij wijlen Daniel Zaeijman, ten voordeele van desselfs ondertenoemen erfgenaemen, als
2 CONT
2 CONT >Pieter Zaeijman, Daniel Zaeijman, Christiaen Zaeijman,
2 CONT
2 CONT >Johannes Diodaetij en Samuel Diodaeti als representeerende haer overleedene moeder, Catharina Zaeijman
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT >Aldus geinventarizeert aen Caap de Goede Hoop den 1:en December 1714.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Inventories of the Orphan Chamber Cape Town Archives Repository, South Africa Reference no.: MOOC8/3.61 on http://databases.tanap.net/mooc/]
2 CONT
2 CONT - JS
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Inventories of the Orphan Chamber Cape Town Archives Repository, South Africa
2 CONT * Reference no.: MOOC8/3.61 (attached)
2 CONT * Daniel Zaeijman
2 CONT * 1 December 1714
2 CONT
2 CONT >"Pieter Zaeijman, Daniel Zaeijman, Christiaen Zaeijman, Johannes Diodaetij en Samuel Diodaeti, ...als representeerende haer overleedene moeder, Catharina Zaeijman"
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>______________
2 CONT
2 CONT *(Crampton, Hazel (2014) ''The Side Of The Sun At Noon''. South Africa: Jacana). 
