1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Henri Louis Frédéric de Saussure''' was a Swiss mineralogist and entomologist specialising in studies of Hymenoptera and Orthoptera. He also was a prolific taxonomist. He was the son of Alphonse  Jean Francoise 
2 CONC de Saussure. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His elementary education was at Briquet then, at an advanced level at the Institute of Fellenberg. At Fellenberg he was taught by François Jules Pictet de la Rive who introduced him to entomology. After several years study in Pari
2 CONC s where he received the degree of licenciate of the Faculty of Paris and obtaining the degree Doctor from the University of Gießen.
2 CONT
2 CONT He worked mainly on Hymenoptera and Orthoptera. His first paper, in 1852, was on solitary wasps.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1854 he travelled to the West Indies, then to Mexico and the United States of America. There he met Louis Agassiz. He returned to Switzerland in 1856 with collections of American insects, myriapods, crustaceans, birds and mamma
2 CONC ls. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was also interested in geography, geology and ethnology and founded the Geographical Society of Geneva in 1858. He was also a member of the managing committee of the Natural History Museum of Geneva ensuring that it’s collectio
2 CONC ns of Hymenoptera and Orthoptera became one of the best in the world.  In 1872 he was made an Honorary Fellow of the Entomological Society of London.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry married Louise Elisabeth de POURTALÈS in Geneva on September 30, 1856, and had a large family. Famous linguist Ferdinand de Saussure was his eldest son.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Henri Louis Frederic de Saussure and wife Louise Elisabeth de Pourtales:
2 CONT * Ferdinand (le linguiste) de SAUSSURE, the linguist
2 CONT *  Horace de SAUSSURE
2 CONT *  Albertine Adèle de SAUSSURE
2 CONT *  Elisabeth Théodora de SAUSSURE
2 CONT *  Léopold de SAUSSURE 1866-1925 married 20 May 1895 to Germaine DUVAL 1876-1920
2 CONT *  René de SAUSSURE married 17 June 1898 to Catherine Amélie MAURICE
2 CONT *  Jeanne de SAUSSURE
2 CONT *  Louis Octave de SAUSSURE
2 CONT *  Maximilien de SAUSSURE
2 CONT
2 CONT Links to additional material:
2 CONT *http://openlibrary.org/authors/OL2384791A/Henri_de_Saussure
