2 CONT
2 CONT * Born on 30 May 1770 at Lew Trenchard, Devon,
2 CONT * Son of Charles Baring and Margaret Gould.
2 CONT * Married Diana Amelia Sabine, daughter of Colonel Joseph Sabine and Sarah Hunt, on 8 March 1801.
2 CONT * Died on 31 October 1846 at age 76.1
2 CONT * He was given the name of William Baring at birth
2 CONT * On 14 July 1795 his name was legally changed to William Baring-Gould by Royal Licence.
2 CONT * Justice of the Peace (J.P.) for Devon
2 CONT * Deputy Lieutenant (D.L.) of Devon.
2 CONT * He lived at Lew Trenchard, Devon, '''Children of William Baring-Gould and Diana Amelia Sabine'''
