1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MARIA PASLEY (otherwise MARIA PAISLEY) ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Maria Pasley, here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Pasley-Baronet/6000000019272124375?through=6000000019333055943 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Haywood/6000000019309697612?through=
2 CONC 6000000019333055943. [http://www.thepeerage.com/p54837.htm#i548368 Darryl Lundy's Peerage] She was born on 2 April 1775 and her baptism was registered on 4 May 1775, at Westerkirk in Eskdale, Dumfriesshire, Scotland. Her place of 
2 CONC birth and the name of her mother is not recorded in her baptismal record. Her baptismal record reads as follows: "1775. May 4th. Captain Thos. Paisley son to the deceased Jas, Paisley of Craig had a daughter baptized named Maria b
2 CONC orn April 2nd." [National Records of Scotland, Westerkirk Baptisms, reference OPR.854/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000208892576850 Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Maria Pasley, here treated, is reported to have died at Douglas on the Isle of Man on 22 May 1839. [The Gentleman's Magazine. By Sylvanus Urban, Gent. Volume XII New Series. MDCCCXXXIX July to December Inclusive (William Picker
2 CONC ing, John Bower Nichols and Son, London, 1839), page 102]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Maria Pasley, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/John-Sabine/6000000019333390371 on 21 August 1800.  They were married at the church of Saint Marylebone, Saint Marylebone Road, Saint Marylebone, London, England. 
2 CONC [http://www.thepeerage.com/p54837.htm#i548367 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
