2 CONT
2 CONT Missionary - First wife of William Jones Boone.   From 1837 to 1840 were missionaries in Djakarta, Java (known then as Batavia.)  In 1840 they went to Macao and in 1842 established a mission at Kulang-see near Amoy. 
2 CONT Two known children - Henry William Boone and Mary Eliza (Boone) Walker.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/93207425/sarah_amelia-boone Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy
