1 NAME Ferdinand Mongin /de Saussure/
2 GIVN Ferdinand Mongin
2 SURN de Saussure
2 _MARNM de Saussure
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 NOV 1857
2 ADDR
3 CITY Geneva
3 CTRY Switzerland
