1 NOTE {geni:about_me} René de Saussure was a Swiss Esperantist and professional mathematician, who composed important works about Esperanto and interlinguistics from a linguistic viewpoint. His chef d'ouevre is an analysis on the logic 
2 CONC of word construction in Esperanto, Fundamentaj reguloj de la vortteorio en Esperanto, ("Fundamental rules of word theory in Esperanto") defending Esperanto against several Idist critiques. He developed the concept of neceso kaj su
2 CONC fiĉo ("necessity and sufficience") by which he opposed the criticism of Louis Couturat that Esperanto lacks recursion.
2 CONT
2 CONT René was the brother of the famous linguist Ferdinand de Saussure.
