1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maitland Warren Bouverie Sabine Pasley was born on 17 July 1834.1 He was the son of Admiral Sir Thomas Pasley, 2nd Bt. and Jane Matilda Lily Wynyard. He married Katherine Henson Grehan, daughter of Major unknown Gr
2 CONC ehan, on 20 October 1859. He died on 6 June 1881 at age 46. He gained the rank of Major in the Royal Artillery.1 He gained the rank of Adjutant in the Sussex Artillery. Children of Maitland Warren Bouverie Sabine Pasley and Kather
2 CONC ine Henson Grehan: 
