1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://gw.geneanet.org/pevelyne?lang=en&p=natalie&n=mallet Geneanet Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 26 2024, 12:50:35 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT “IX. Louis-Jules Mallet (son of Guillaume and Anne-Julie Houel), born on July 14, 1789, died in 1800. Married on August 29, 1812, Emilie, daughter of Christophe-Philippe Oberkampf and Elisabeth Massieu, died on Sep 11, 1856. Natal
2 CONC ie, born Dec 26, 1813, died Feb 12, 1884, wife, May 23, 1839, of Pierre-Antoine Labouchère, painter.” https://archive.org/details/noticesgnalo22gali/page/n399
2 CONT ===Individual Note===
2 CONT 1874-1875 : demeure boulevard Malesherbes n° 24 à Paris VIII
