2 CONC 1 - 1886  Children: Robert Charles Blanding 1861 - 1936  (Buried: Concord Presbyterian Church Cemetery Sumter S.C.) Mary Adelaide Blanding  James McFaddin Blanding Caroline DeSaussure Blanding Emma Blanding Leonora McFaddin Blandi
