2 CONC eave [S.O. 97/5  Dept. SC-Ga-Fla   Gen. Beauregard] 04/27/1864 - Asst. Medical Officer, 1st & 2nd SC Artillery, James Island, SC 05/14/1864 - Announced [S.O. 134/8  Dept. SC-Ga-Fla   Gen. Sam Jones] 06/23/1864 - Assigned to the 2n
