2 CONC  died in 1908) 1866 - Practiced medicine, Camden, Kershaw Co., SC 1880 - Practiced medicine, Kirkwood, Kershaw Co., SC (indexed in the 1880 U.S. Census as Aw Burnett) 1886,1890,1893 - Practiced medicine, Camden, Kershaw Co., SC 06
