1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography==
2 CONT His maternal grandmother raised him from 1924 to 1934.
2 CONT
2 CONT He apparently had no surname until 1933, when he took on his father's surname.
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Protestantism Protestant] orphanage from 1937 to 1942.
2 CONT
2 CONT He registered for military service on February 12, 1942, and ended his military service in 1959 with the rank of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sergeant sergeant].  He was a prisoner of war from March 1942 to August 15, 1945 (duri
2 CONC ng [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_II World War II]); as such, he was imprisoned in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Singapore Singapore], [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thailand Thailand] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
2 CONC /Burma Burma].
2 CONT
2 CONT As a draftsman engineer, he designed parts for [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_shuttle space shuttles].
