2 CONT MARRIAGE. 
2 CONT PASLEY-INNES.—On the 8th November, at St. John's Church, Invercargill, by the Yen. Archdeacon Stacker, Montagu T. Sabine, eldest son of it. Sabine Pasley, Esq., Kew, Invercargill, and grandson of the late Admiral Sir T. Sabine Pas
