2 CONT Miss Adele Langdon Linton. 4914 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Minnesota.  Descendant of Hon. John Hart, of New Jersey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT LINEAGE BOOK. 321 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Alonzo Herbert Linton and Gertrude Darragh, his wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Granddaughter of James Darragh and Marian Eliza Reno, his wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gr.-granddaughter of Robert Darragh and Deborah Hart, his wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gr.-gr.-granddaughter of Jesse Hart and Martha Mattison, his wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gr.-gr.-gr.-granddaughter of John Hart and Deborah Scudder, his  wife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Hart, from 1776-78, was elected by a unanimous vote  Speaker of the Legislature. He was a member of the Commit-  tee of Safety, delegate to the Continental Congress and a signer  of the Declaration of Independence. He also se
2 CONC rved in the  army during the Revolution. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also Nos. 193, 987, 2383, 3233. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Miss Marian Darragh Linton. 491^ 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Pennsylvania.  Descendant of Hon. John Hart. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Alonzo Herbert Linton and Gertrude Darragh, his wife.  See No. 4914. 
