1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''I found this: - WB'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Cathleen Sabine Mann Douglas''' was the wife of Francis Douglas, 11th Marquess of Queensberry.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a portrait and flower painter who trained at the Slade School and exhibited at the Royal Academy and Royal Society of Portrait Painters.  She was a member of various painter societies.  She and the Marquess divorced in 194
2 CONC 6.  '''She committed suicide in 1959'''.
2 CONT
