2 CONC gement d'adoption s'appela désormais Peyre-Foulc.* Reference: [https://gw.geneanet.org/belise1?lang=en&pz=beatrice&nz=hannecart&ocz=0&p=marguerite+adrienne&n=peyre+foulc Geneanet Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCo
