2 NICK Blanding
1 NAME James Douglas Blanding Haman
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vaiden
3 STAE Mississippi
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 JAN 1892
