1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was a cotton merchant from Charleston, South Carolina. In the early 20th century the family company was renamed Edward T. Robertson & Son as his son joined him as a partner.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/45475457/edward-twells-robertson
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Twells Robertson, born 17 September 1856, died 10 February 1914, married 22 December 1881 to Sara Gilmor Ladson. Issue:
2 CONT *1) Mary Ladson Robertson
2 CONT *2) Edward Twells Robertson. After the death of his first wife he was married in his second marriage on 25 March 1899 to Natalie Breckenridge Johnson. Issue:
2 CONT *3) Natalie Breckenridge Robertson
2 CONT *4) Lewis Ford Robertson.
2 CONT
2 CONT (''[https://books.google.com/books?id=61ZPAAAAMAAJ The Reverend George Robertson [1662–1739] Rector of Bristol Parish, Virginia [1693–1739] and His Descendants]'' p. 17)
