2 CONT Warren PASLEY Obituary
2 CONT PASLEY, Warren Sabine:
2 CONT Passed away peacefully at Christchurch Hospital, on January 6, 2018, aged 86 years. Beloved and cherished husband of Di, step-father of Scott and Karyn, and Dean and Julia, much loved Wazza of Zac, Cooper, Logan, Zoe, and Ava, fat
2 CONC her of Joanne, and Jonathan, grandfather of Jonty and great-grandfather of Harper. A special thanks to all the medical staff for their love and care of Warren. Messages may be addressed to The Family of the late Warren Pasley, c/-
2 CONC  PO Box 39001, Christchurch 8545. Donations to the Sumner Surf Life Saving Club would be appreciated and may be made at the service. A Memorial Service for Warren will be held in our AvonPark Chapel, corner of Kerrs and Pages Road
2 CONC s, Linwood, on Friday, January 12, at 2.30pm.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Published by The Press from Jan. 8 to Jan. 10, 2018.
