2 CONT John Pasley Obituary
2 CONT PASLEY, John Clinton Sabine. Aged 74, died peacefully at Pinesong, Auckland on 5 February 2011. Much loved and loving husband of Megan and Monica (departed). Brother, uncle, cousin and friend to many. Loved and respected father; M
2 CONC atthew and Julie, Paul and Amanda, John and Rose, Thomas, Clare and Martin. Grandfather to; Thomas and Sophie, Andrew and Ana, Ali, James, Emma, Frankie, Liam, Sam, Issy, Thomas, Claudia, Rachel, Martin, Gabriel, Nicholas and Ange
2 CONC la. A service to celebrate John's life will be held at North Shore Memorial Park Crematorium and Chapel, 235 Schnapper Rock Road, Albany at 2.30pm on Thursday 10 February 2011.
2 CONT To plant trees in memory, please visit the Sympathy Store.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published by The New Zealand Herald on Feb. 7, 2011.
