1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Meta Cantey Boykin Rose, born December 18, 1924 in Boykin, South Carolina, daughter of Meta Cantey Boykin and Bolivar De Saussure Boykin.
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1967 to 1981 she lived in Middletown, Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT She grew up in Camden, South Carolina and graduated from St Mary’s School, Raleigh, North Carolina and attended The University of South Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a licensed pilot and went by the name “Pete”. She was an active and lifetime Board member of the Boykin Spaniel Society.
