1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sinclair - Frederick Walker Sinclair Jr., Insurance Agent And Past President Of Sinclair Agency Died Monday February 7, 2005 At East Jefferson General Hospital. He Was 88 Years Old. Mr. Sinclair Was Born In New Orl
2 CONC eans And Lived Here His Entire Life. He Attended Louisiana State University Before Entering The Insurance Business In 1937. Within Three Years, And For Three Years In A Row, He Was Among The Top Travelers Life And Accident Insuran
2 CONC ce Agents. In 1943 He Became President Of Sinclair Insurance Agency And Maintained That Position Until 1973. Mr. Sinclair Was Quite Active At Trinity Episcopal Church Where He Served On The Sunday School Committee, Ushers Committe
2 CONC e And Associate Vestry. He Also Trained Acolytes, Served As A Lay Reader And Became A Lay Eucharistic Minister And Chalis Bearer. His Death Was Preceded By Those Of His Wife, Mary Abel Sinclair In November 2002 And His Youngest So
2 CONC n, Franklin Jefferson Sinclair In January 2001. Survivors Include His Son, Frederick (Rick) Walker Sinclair Iii, His Daughter, Anne Sinclair Buescher, Two Grandsons And A Granddaughter, And Two Sisters, Nellie S. Hillyer And Evely
2 CONC n S. Moyer Of Pass Christian, Ms. Relatives And Friends Are Invited To Attend The Funeral Services At Trinity Episcopal Church, 1329 Jackson Ave., New Orleans On Friday February 11, 2005 At 11:00 Am. Interment Will Follow In Metai
2 CONC rie Cemetery. 
